  DTS:Description="Make sure every conformed domain has the UNKNOWN member the fact loads route to when a code cannot be translated, and refresh ref.SourceKeyCrosswalk so an ERP product code and an OLTP stock item id resolve to the same conformed business key. The unknown members come from ref.StatusCode and ref.ReasonCode rather than from a separate inventory table."
